# The compiled collector binary.
#
# `go build ./...` inside a main package writes its output next to the source,
# under the package's own name — so an ordinary local build drops ./k8s here and
# a careless `git add -A` commits a platform-specific binary. The repository's
# root ignore file names the other three binaries individually
# (/knowledge, /knowledge-server, /frontend) because they land at the repo root;
# this one lands here, so the entry lives here.
/k8s
